PROSE SUMMARY (context, not a substitute for the structured log above)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
Long 22-turn grind. Guccjiit's Rushoar repeatedly demolished lonely whale's cheap Primitive Furnace rebuilds (turns 1, 4) while lonely whale's Menasting traded up into Guccjiit's Digtoise (turn 3). Guccjiit's early Flopie poke was fully nullified by a paid-Soul Pyrin Noct interrupt (turn 4), and lonely whale's Reptyro survived repeated bare-form interrupts across the game - Wumpo Botan (turns 6, 13, 19) and Dinossom (turn 9) - while Guccjiit's own Digtoise swing was nullified by a paid-Soul Blazehowl Noct (turn 11) and a later Rushoar swing nullified by a paid-Soul Pyrin Noct (turn 20). lonely whale's Foxparks/Menasting/Reptyro ground Guccjiit down steadily from turn 6 onward (11->9->8->6->5->3->2->0) while a Felbat lifegain engine (gained 1 life per attack, turns 16/19/22) pushed lonely whale's own life above its starting total, closing at 11. Several of lonely whale's own attacks were also Lucky-Pal-cancelled along the way (turns 10, 13, 16, 22). Reptyro landed the final blow turn 22 (2 to 0).


